# Claude Code runtime state — .claude/settings.json is checked-in project
# config (shared plugin/permission setup), but worktrees/ is per-machine
# runtime metadata from EnterWorktree, never meant to be committed.
.claude/worktrees/

# personal bank statement exports (ex: Nubank .csv import via /minha-conta)
# — real personal financial data, never meant to be committed (see the
# 2026-09-20 incident: paa.csv had leaked real PIX transaction data with
# third-party names and partial document numbers). No .csv is otherwise
# tracked in this repo.
*.csv

